%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-repeat (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
{
  "a": repeat("e", 0),
  "b": repeat("e", 3),
  "c": repeat("e", -2)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": "",
  "b": "eee",
  "c": ""
}
